From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:23:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter/vf_tonemap_opencl: detect the bt2408_hable signal
 peak on the GPU

Static mastering metadata often overstates the real peak (MaxCLL 4000
or 10000 on content that peaks far lower), which leaves bt2408_hable
output too dark. Add peak_detect, as in tonemap and tonemap_vulkan:
a 16x16 tile kernel measures each frame in PQ, and the shared
tonemap_peak code smooths the result with the threshold option as
the scene-change threshold. Off by default; output is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
---
